  "content": "[Intro]\n[Bbsus2]  [Eb/G]\n[Eb]  [Fsus4]\n[Bbsus2]  [Eb/G]\n[Bb/Eb]\n[Bbsus2]  [Eb/G]\n[Eb]  [Fsus4]\n[Bbsus2]  [Eb/G]\n[Bb/Eb]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bbadd9/D]When I was down and\n[Bb/Eb]no one knew my name\n[Bbadd9/D]You gave me hope and I\n[Bb/Eb]never felt the shame\n[Bbsus4/C]You were my strength when I\n[Bbadd9/D]couldn't find a friend\n[Bb/Eb]You seemed to have a\n[F]faith that never ends You're the\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bbadd9/D]glory of my longing The\n[Eb/G]glory of my [Bb/Eb]tears The\n[Cm]glory of my [Gm]loneliness that\n[Gm]seems to last for [F]years You're\nthe [Bbadd9/D]glory of my struggles to be\n[Bbsus4]who I want to be [Bb/Eb]\nThe\n[Cm]good that came [Bb/D]from everything that\n[Bb/Eb]seemed so hard [Bb/D]on me the happy\n[Cm]ending [Bb/D]to my story...\n[Bb/Eb]You Your'e the\n\n[Interlude]\n[Bbsus2]Glory [Eb/G]\n[Eb]  [Fsus4]\n[Bbsus2]  [Eb/G]\n[Bb/Eb]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Csus2]When I was cold you\n[Csus4]became my fire\n[Csus2]You stirred my soul... made\n[Csus4]me reach much higher\n[Dm]And through your eyes I saw\n[Em]all that I could be\n[F]I'm only here cause\n[G]you believed in me You're the\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]glory of my longing The\n[Fsus2]glory of my tears The\n[Dm]glory of my [C]loneliness that\n[Am7]seems to last for [G5]years You're\n[C]the glory of my struggles to be\n[Fsus2/E]who I want to [Fsus2]be\n[C]The\n[Dm]good that came from [C]everything that\n[Fsus2]seemed so hard on me the happy\n[Dm]ending to [C]my story...\n[Fsus2]You You're the\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Bb]glory when I stop to count my blessings\n[Am]Glo-\n[G]ry when I realized the true\n[F#m]I have\n[Bm]everything I need... as\n[C]long as I have you You are the\n\n[Chorus]\n[D]glory of my longing The\n[Bm]glory of my tears The\n[Em]glory of my [D]loneliness that\n[Bm]seems to last for [A]years You're\n[D]the glory of my struggles to be\n[F#m]who I want to [G]be\n[Bm]The\n[Em]good that came from [F#m]everything that\n[G]seemed so hard [A]on me the happy\n[Em]ending to [F#m]my story...\n[G]You\nYour'e the\n\n[Outro]\n[D]Glory [G/B]\n[D/G][A]You are,\n[D]  [G/B]\n[D/G]you are the\n[D]Glory, [G/B]\n[D/G][A]you are...\n[D]  [G/B]\n[D/G]",
